{"mod_id": "tfm2_inhibitor", "name": "Inhibitors & Super Minions", "author": "tfm2mods", "version": "0.1.7", "description": "League of Legends-style inhibitors for 5v5 matches.\n\n* Every lane gets an inhibitor behind its second tower, with its own crystal-pedestal sprite. Inhibitors never attack.\n* An inhibitor can only be damaged after both towers of its lane are destroyed.\n* The two nexus towers can only be damaged while at least one of their team's inhibitors is down. Once both nexus towers fall, the nexus is open.\n* While an inhibitor is down, every enemy minion wave in that lane brings one extra super minion (a big armored knight with its own sprite and much more attack, health and armor).\n* Destroyed inhibitors come back after 5 minutes.\n* The AI understands the new rules: it sieges inhibitors after the second tower and goes for the nexus once the nexus towers are down.\n\nSettings: config/inhibitor.cfg - which lanes get an inhibitor (all three, or e.g. mid only), inhibitor respawn time and health, super minion attack/health/armor/magic resist, and the rule switches. Restart the game after editing.\n\nSettings file comments are in English and Korean. Built for game 0.7.4 (5v5 matches only). Code mod (native DLL, Windows only).", "last_updated": "2026-11-27", "dependencies": [{"mod_id": "base", "version": ">=0.7.4, <0.7.5"}]}